      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "将来，在指导那些\n从她手中接过接力棒的孩子们时，\n这份理解也应该能派上用场……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b92b84b1f94b735efa910e4091a528b349c57eb0eac6f6fbb280a8455899cc6",
